<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Case Study: Vimergy - PE-Backed Supplement Brand Transformation</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #2c3e50;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #11998e 0%, #38ef7d 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
            animation: slideUp 0.8s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes slideUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(30px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2d5016 0%, #3e7b27 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
            animation: rotate 20s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes rotate {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .header .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 40px;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            padding: 30px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .section:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .section h2 {
            color: #2d5016;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #11998e;
            position: relative;
        }

        .section h2::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -3px;
            left: 0;
            width: 50px;
            height: 3px;
            background: #38ef7d;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .section p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .challenges ul, .actions ol {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding-left: 0;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .challenges li {
            background: #fff5f5;
            border-left: 4px solid #e74c3c;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        }

        .challenges li:hover {
            transform: translateX(5px);
        }

        .pe-challenge {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffeaa7 0%, #fdcb6e 100%);
            border-left: 4px solid #f39c12;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .actions li {
            background: #f0fff4;
            border-left: 4px solid #11998e;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
            counter-increment: action-counter;
        }

        .actions {
            counter-reset: action-counter;
        }

        .actions li::before {
            content: counter(action-counter);
            background: #11998e;
            color: white;
            width: 25px;
            height: 25px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-right: 10px;
            float: left;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .actions li:hover {
            transform: translateX(5px);
        }

        .results {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8f9fa 0%, #e9ecef 100%);
        }

        .results ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .results li {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4edda 0%, #c3e6cb 100%);
            border-left: 4px solid #28a745;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .results li:hover {
            transform: translateX(5px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(40, 167, 69, 0.2);
        }

        .metrics {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .metric-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .metric-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .metric-number {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #28a745;
            display: block;
        }

        .metric-label {
            color: #6c757d;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        .highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #11998e 0%, #38ef7d 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .pe-highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f39c12 0%, #e67e22 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .tech-highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3498db 0%, #2980b9 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .back-link {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            left: 20px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #2d5016;
            font-weight: bold;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .back-link:hover {
            background: #11998e;
            color: white;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .company-profile {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8f5e8 0%, #c8e6c9 100%);
            border: 2px solid #11998e;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .business-model {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .channel-badge {
            background: #11998e;
            color: white;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .oversight-role {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff3e0 0%, #ffe0b2 100%);
            border: 2px solid #f39c12;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        .no-testimonial {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8f9fa 0%, #e9ecef 100%);
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            color: #6c757d;
            border: 2px dashed #dee2e6;
        }

        .no-testimonial p {
            font-style: italic;
            margin: 0;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container {
                margin: 10px;
                border-radius: 15px;
            }
            
            .header {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }
            
            .header h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            
            .content {
                padding: 20px;
            }
            
            .section {
                padding: 20px;
                margin-bottom: 25px;
            }
            
            .back-link {
                position: static;
                display: inline-block;
                margin-bottom: 20px;
            }

            .business-model {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <a href="#" class="back-link">← Back to Portfolio</a>
    
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Case Study: Vimergy</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">PE-Backed Organic Supplement Brand Transformation</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <div class="section">
                <h2>Client Profile</h2>
                <p>Private-equity-backed organic supplement brand experiencing rapid DTC growth and expanding wholesale channels.</p>
                <div class="company-profile">
                    <div><strong>PE-Backed Organic Supplement Brand</strong></div>
                    <div class="business-model">
                        <span class="channel-badge">Direct-to-Consumer</span>
                        <span class="channel-badge">Wholesale Channels</span>
                        <span class="channel-badge">Rapid Growth</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section">
                <h2>My Role</h2>
                <p><strong>Solution Architect / Internal Systems Director</strong> – engaged by senior management to act as an independent advisor overseeing West Monroe's implementation work, stabilizing the NetSuite environment, and designing value-add enhancements.</p>
                <div class="oversight-role">
                    <strong>Independent Oversight:</strong> Providing internal expertise to validate external integrator deliverables and ensure quality standards
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section challenges">
                <h2>Key Challenges</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li class="pe-challenge">Leadership sought an internal expert perspective and additional hands to validate <span class="pe-highlight">integrator deliverables</span> and ensure quality</li>
                    <li>No consolidated management-reporting package for <span class="pe-highlight">PE board reviews</span></li>
                    <li>Manual, error-prone procurement approvals and vendor-bill processing; limited three-way-match controls</li>
                    <li>Quality processes tracked outside ERP; compliance risk as order volume scaled</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section">
                <h2>Actions Taken</h2>
                <ol class="actions">
                    <li><strong>Implementation Oversight & QA:</strong> Reviewed <span class="tech-highlight">West Monroe</span> design docs, scripts, and configurations; flagged gaps and provided remediation guidance to keep project on-track.</li>
                    <li><strong>Management-Reporting Package (Solution 7):</strong> Architected a scalable <span class="tech-highlight">Solution 7</span> management-reporting stack that streams live NetSuite data into Excel—eliminated prior crash issues, delivered reliable monthly/quarterly <span class="pe-highlight">PE board packs</span>, and cut manual report prep to near-zero.</li>
                    <li><strong>Quality Management Module (QMM):</strong> Implemented <span class="tech-highlight">NetSuite QMM</span> to track inspections, non-conformances, and lot traceability inside ERP, eliminating offline spreadsheets.</li>
                    <li><strong>Procure-to-Pay Automation:</strong> Developed approval workflows for stand-alone vendor bills and purchase orders; implemented three-way-match logic to prevent over-billing and strengthen controls.</li>
                    <li><strong>End-User Enablement:</strong> Led training sessions across Finance, Supply Chain, and Quality teams; improved user confidence and reduced external support tickets.</li>
                </ol>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section results">
                <h2>Results</h2>
                <div class="metrics">
                    <div class="metric-card">
                        <span class="metric-number">50%</span>
                        <div class="metric-label">Procurement Cycle Reduction</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric-card">
                        <span class="metric-number">Zero</span>
                        <div class="metric-label">Manual Report Prep</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric-card">
                        <span class="metric-number">100%</span>
                        <div class="metric-label">Lot-Level Traceability</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric-card">
                        <span class="metric-number">Low→High</span>
                        <div class="metric-label">User Confidence Jump</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>PE leadership gained real-time visibility</strong> via the new management package—eliminated monthly manual PowerPoint builds</li>
                    <li>Procurement approval cycle time cut in half; three-way-match reduced vendor-invoice discrepancies</li>
                    <li><strong>QMM adoption ensured full lot-level traceability,</strong> satisfying upcoming regulatory audits</li>
                    <li>NetSuite user-confidence survey rose from <strong>"Low" to "High"</strong> within three months of hyper-care</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section no-testimonial">
                <h2>Project Outcome</h2>
                <p>Successful implementation oversight and enhancement delivery - project completed to specifications with measurable improvements in reporting, compliance, and user adoption.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
